@startuml
title Odysseus - Domain Layer

top to bottom direction
hide empty description

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 18
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam ArrowThickness 2
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam defaultFontColor #0F172A
skinparam TitleFontColor #0F172A

skinparam rectangle {
    BorderColor #CBD5E1
    FontColor #0F172A
}

skinparam package {
    BorderColor #94A3B8
    FontColor #334155
}

skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
    BorderColor #D6B656
    FontColor #334155
}


package "domain/availability.py" #FAF5FF {
    rectangle "<b>Weekday</b>\n<i>StrEnum</i>\n\nmonday\ntuesday\nwednesday\nthursday\nfriday\nsaturday\nsunday" as Weekday #F3E8FF

    rectangle "<b>DailyTrainingAvailability</b>\n<i>frozen dataclass</i>\n\nweekday: Weekday\nam_available: bool\npm_available: bool\nis_rest_day: bool" as Daily #EDE9FE

    rectangle "<b>RecurringTrainingAvailability</b>\n<i>frozen dataclass</i>\n\ndays: tuple[DailyTrainingAvailability, ...]" as Recurring #E9D5FF
}

package "domain/goals.py" #FAF5FF {
    rectangle "<b>GoalStatus</b>\n<i>StrEnum</i>\n\nactive\ncompleted\ncancelled\ninactive" as GoalStatus #F3E8FF

    rectangle "<b>Goal</b>\n<i>frozen dataclass</i>\n\nid: UUID\ntitle: str\nstatus: GoalStatus\ntarget_date: date | None = None\ntarget_event_id: UUID | None = None" as Goal #EDE9FE
}

package "domain/target_events.py" #FAF5FF {
    rectangle "<b>TargetEventType</b>\n<i>StrEnum</i>\n\nrunning\nhyrox\nstrength\nother" as TargetEventType #F3E8FF

    rectangle "<b>TargetEventStatus</b>\n<i>StrEnum</i>\n\nactive\ncompleted\ncancelled\ninactive" as TargetEventStatus #F3E8FF

    rectangle "<b>TargetEvent</b>\n<i>frozen dataclass</i>\n\nid: UUID\nname: str\nevent_date: date\nevent_type: TargetEventType\nstatus: TargetEventStatus" as TargetEvent #EDE9FE
}

Recurring --> Daily : contains exactly one per weekday
Daily --> Weekday : identifies day
Goal --> GoalStatus : status
TargetEvent --> TargetEventType : event type
TargetEvent --> TargetEventStatus : status
Goal ..> TargetEvent : optional reference by UUID

note right of Goal
<b>Invariant</b>

Title must not be empty or whitespace-only.

Target date and target event ID are optional.
No event existence check is performed here.
end note

note right of TargetEvent
<b>Invariant</b>

Name must not be empty or whitespace-only.

A dated event can exist without linked goals.
end note

note bottom of Goal
Goals and target events use caller-supplied UUIDs.
Past dates are valid; dates do not change statuses.
GoalStatus and TargetEventStatus are separate types.
end note

note right of Daily
<b>Invariant</b>

REST cannot coexist with
AM or PM availability.

Valid ordinary unavailability:
AM=False
PM=False
REST=False

Unavailable and explicit REST
therefore remain different states.
end note

note right of Recurring
<b>Invariant</b>

A recurring week contains
exactly one entry for each weekday.

Missing or duplicate weekdays
are rejected.
end note

note bottom of Recurring
The domain owns training meaning and validity.

It does not know about FastAPI, Jinja,
forms, HTTP, or storage technology.
end note

@enduml
